OL,3,GNEWSAMajor fire at derelict Peaky
OL,4,ABlinders mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother major fire has broken out at a
OL,7,Fderelict mill complex where Peaky
OL,8,FBlinders was filmed.
OL,10,FThe blaze at Dalton Mills in Keighley
OL,11,Fstarted at about 20:00 BST on Saturday
OL,12,Fand at its peak required 12 fire
OL,13,Fengines to tackle it.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,F(WYFRS) confirmed that due to the
OL,17,Fseverity of the incident a number of
OL,18,Fnearby residents were evacuated and at
OL,19,F23:00 BST, 10 fire engines were still
OL,20,Fin attendance.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
